### **EternaFX Unified Framework Equation**

\[
\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
\text{System}(t+1) &= \mathbf{F}\Bigg[ \\
&\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^n \alpha_i(t) \cdot \text{AI}_i(t)}_{\text{Modular AI Agents}} + \\
&\underbrace{\beta \cdot \big(H(t) - C(t)\big)}_{\text{Harmony-Chaos Balance}} + \\
&\underbrace{\gamma \cdot |\zeta(s(t))|}_{\text{Zeta Dynamics}} + \\
&\underbrace{\delta \cdot \frac{dS}{dt}}_{\text{Scenario Generation}} + \\
&\underbrace{\epsilon \cdot E(t)}_{\text{Ethical Decisions}} + \\
&\underbrace{\eta \cdot P(t)}_{\text{User Prompts}} \Bigg] \\
\end{aligned}
}
\]

