### **Component Definitions**

| Term                 | Symbol    | Description                                                                 |
|----------------------|-----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **AI Agents**        | \(\sum \alpha_i \text{AI}_i\) | Weighted contributions of Ada Lovelace AI, Alan Turing AI, etc.             |
| **Harmony-Chaos**    | \(\beta(H - C)\) | Stability metric balancing ethical alignment (\(H\)) and entropy (\(C\))    |
| **Zeta Dynamics**    | \(\gamma|\zeta(s)|\) | Prime-pattern insights modulating computational certainty                   |
| **Scenario Engine**  | \(\delta \frac{dS}{dt}\)      | Rate of scenario evolution: \(S(t+1) = f(S(t), \text{AI}(t), \zeta(s))\)   |
| **Ethical Filter**   | \(\epsilon E(t)\)             | Decisions: \(E(t) = g(H(t) - C(t), S(t))\)                                  |
| **User Interaction** | \(\eta P(t)\)                 | Prompt-driven state perturbations                                           |

